愀挀琀䠀攀愀搀攀爀⸀伀瀀攀爀愀琀椀漀渀一漀Ⰰ 倀栀愀爀洀愀挀礀⸀䐀椀爀攀挀琀匀甀戀猀琀爀愀挀琀䠀攀愀搀攀爀⸀伀瀀攀爀愀琀椀漀渀䐀愀琀攀Ⰰ 倀栀愀爀洀愀挀礀⸀唀渀椀琀猀⸀唀渀椀琀一愀洀攀Ⰰ 倀栀愀爀洀愀挀礀⸀唀渀椀琀䌀漀渀瘀攀爀猀椀漀渀䘀愀挀琀漀爀⸀䌀漀渀瘀攀爀猀椀漀渀嘀愀氀甀攀Ⰰ 倀栀愀爀洀愀挀礀⸀䐀椀爀攀挀琀匀甀戀猀琀爀愀挀琀䐀攀琀愀椀氀猀⸀䐀爀甀最䤀䐀Ⰰ ഀ਀
                         Pharmacy.DirectSubstractDetails.QTY * Pharmacy.UnitConversionFactor.ConversionValue AS Qty, Pharmacy.DirectSubstractDetails.Price, Pharmacy.DirectSubstractDetails.Amount, 
                         Pharmacy.DirectSubstractHeader.SubStockID AS SubstoreID
FROM            Pharmacy.DirectSubstractDetails INNER JOIN
                         Pharmacy.DirectSubstractHeader ON Pharmacy.DirectSubstractDetails.HeaderID = Pharmacy.DirectSubstractHeader.ID INNER JOIN
                         Pharmacy.UnitConversionFactor ON Pharmacy.DirectSubstractDetails.UnitConversionFactorId = Pharmacy.UnitConversionFactor.ID INNER JOIN
                         Pharmacy.Units ON Pharmacy.UnitConversionFactor.UnitID = Pharmacy.Units.ID




GO
