最⸀䌀愀猀栀椀攀爀䈀漀砀⸀一愀洀攀䄀爀                      䄀匀 嬀✀㌆䔆弆✀䐆㔆䘆⼆䠆䈆崆ഀ਀        Ⰰ䈀椀氀氀椀渀最⸀䌀愀猀栀椀攀爀䈀漀砀吀爀愀渀猀昀愀爀攀吀漀䈀愀渀欀⸀䈀漀砀䈀愀氀愀渀挀攀   䄀匀 嬀㄀㔆䨆⼆弆✀䐆㔆䘆⼆䠆䈆崆ഀ਀        Ⰰ䈀椀氀氀椀渀最⸀䌀愀猀栀椀攀爀䈀漀砀吀爀愀渀猀昀愀爀攀吀漀䈀愀渀欀⸀吀爀愀渀猀昀愀爀攀䄀洀漀甀渀琀 䄀匀 嬀䔀⠆䐆㨆弆✀䐆⨆ⴆ䠆䨆䐆崆ഀ਀
    FROM Billing.CashierBoxTransfareToBank
    LEFT JOIN HR.Banks
        ON Billing.CashierBoxTransfareToBank.BankID = HR.Banks.ID
    LEFT JOIN Billing.CashierBox
        ON Billing.CashierBoxTransfareToBank.BoxID = Billing.CashierBox.ID
    WHERE (Billing.CashierBoxTransfareToBank.CreatedDate >= @FromDate OR @FromDate IS NULL)
      AND (Billing.CashierBoxTransfareToBank.CreatedDate <= @ToDate OR @ToDate IS NULL)
      AND (Billing.CashierBoxTransfareToBank.BankID = @BankID OR @BankID IS NULL)
END

