攀猀开吀礀瀀攀 崀㴀䀀匀攀爀瘀椀挀攀䘀攀攀猀吀礀瀀攀ഀ਀ऀऀ                     ⴀⴀ 䌀䄀匀䔀 ഀ਀ऀऀऀऀऀऀ    ⴀⴀ   圀䠀䔀一 倀䈀匀⸀䘀攀攀开吀礀瀀攀 㴀 ㈀  吀䠀䔀一  䀀䐀攀琀攀挀琀䘀攀攀猀吀礀瀀攀ഀ਀ऀऀऀऀऀऀऀ   ⴀⴀ圀䠀䔀一 倀䈀匀⸀䘀攀攀开吀礀瀀攀 㴀 ㌀ 吀䠀䔀一   䀀伀瀀攀爀愀琀椀漀渀䘀攀攀猀吀礀瀀攀ഀ਀ऀऀऀऀऀऀऀ   ⴀⴀ䔀䰀匀䔀 䀀匀攀爀瘀椀挀攀䘀攀攀猀吀礀瀀攀ഀ਀ऀऀऀऀऀऀऀ   ⴀⴀ䔀一䐀ഀ਀
 ,isNull(ref.MonthFees,0)  refMonthFees
		 ,Doc.SpecialtyId

FROM    Billing.PatientBillservices AS PBS INNER JOIN
                         OutPatient.InvestigationRequestHeader AS IRH INNER JOIN
                         Registration.Patients AS Pat ON Pat.Id = IRH.PatientID INNER JOIN
                         OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails AS IRD ON IRD.InvestigationRequestId = IRH.Id INNER JOIN
                         ApplicationSetup.Service AS Serv ON Serv.Id = IRD.ServiceId ON PBS.ItemID = Serv.Id AND PBS.OP_IPNumber = IRH.OP_IPNumber
						  LEFT OUTER JOIN [TempTable] ON Pat.SponsorId = [TempTable].[IcId] AND Serv.Id = [TempTable].ServiceId
						  INNER JOIN
                         Registration.Doctors AS Doc ON IRH.DoctorID = Doc.Id
						 Left Outer Join  Billing.DoctorFees_Doctors dfd on Doc.Id=dfd.DoctorID
						 	left outer join InPatient.ReferralType ref on ref.Id=Doc.RefTypeID
WHERE (Serv.hasDevice=0 or Serv.hasDevice is NULL) and IRH.DoctorID=@DoctorId and IRH.ReqDate >= Convert(date,@DateFrom) and IRH.ReqDate<= Convert(date,@DateTo)--and PBS.Paid=1
and PBS.Fee_Type = 1
 and doc.id=@DoctorId






