吀䬀⸀吀䬀吀开䄀䴀吀⤀ 㰀㸀 　 琀栀攀渀  ⠀䤀匀一唀䰀䰀⠀⠀匀䔀䰀䔀䌀吀 匀唀䴀⠀倀䄀夀开䄀䴀吀⤀ 昀爀漀洀 䄀䤀刀开倀䄀夀  圀栀攀爀攀 䄀䤀刀开䌀伀䐀㴀䄀䰀⸀䄀䤀刀开䌀伀䐀 䄀一䐀 倀䄀夀开吀夀倀 䤀一 ⠀✀㐀✀⤀⤀Ⰰ　⤀⤀ ⼀ 䄀䰀⸀䄀䤀刀开䈀䄀匀 ⨀ 䄀吀䬀⸀吀䬀吀开䄀䴀吀 䔀䰀匀䔀 　 䔀一䐀ഀ਀
		,TKT_ORCOMM =  case  when AIR_BAS <> 0 then ((AL.air_or - AL.air_Ort) / AL.AIR_BAS) * ATK.TKT_AMT ELSE 0 END
		,TKT_DISCOUNT =  CASE WHEN AL.AIR_BAS <> 0 Then ISNULL(((ATK.TKT_AMT *(SELECT SUM(PAY_AMT) AS Disc FROM  AIR_PAY where AIR_COD=AL.AIR_COD))/AL.AIR_BAS),0) ELSE 0 END ,TAXES=ISNULL((AIR_TAX1+AIR_TAX2+AIR_TAX3+AIR_TAX4+AIR_TAX5+AIR_STMP) ,0)
		,NETCOMM = ISNULL(((AIR_COMM + AIR_OR)  - (AIR_COMT + AIR_ORT)),0)
		,NETINCOME = ( CASE WHEN AIR_K_TYP IN('1','2') THEN ISNULL((((AIR_COMM + AIR_OR)  - (AIR_COMT + AIR_ORT))+AIR_S_F - isnull((SELECT SUM(PAY_AMT) from AIR_PAY  Where AIR_COD=AL.AIR_COD AND PAY_TYP IN ('1','2') ),0) ),0)
					--REFUND
					WHEN AIR_K_TYP IN('3') THEN  ISNULL((-abs((AIR_COMM + AIR_OR)  - (AIR_COMT + AIR_ORT)) - abs(AIR_S_F) + abs(  isnull((SELECT SUM(PAY_AMT) from AIR_PAY  Where AIR_COD=AL.AIR_COD AND PAY_TYP IN ('1','2','4') ),0) ) ),0) END )

			FROM AIR_LINE as AL	INNER JOIN  AIR_TKT as ATK ON AL.AIR_COD = ATK.AIR_COD   
				where  air_dat Between @FromDate and @ToDate
					and ((AL.AIR_ACC =@MainAcc)or(@MainAcc is null))
					and ((CST_NO =@SubAcc)or(@SubAcc is Null))

					and(( UPPER(AL.air_comp) =@AirLine)or(@AirLine is null))
					and ((UPPER(ATK.TKT_OR) =@TourCode )or(@TourCode is null))
					and  (--@Destenation1
					   ((UPPER(AL.AIR_DESTINATION) like upper('%' + @Destenation1 + '%' ))or(@Destenation1 is null))
					or ((UPPER(AL.AIR_DESTINATION) like upper('%' + @Destenation2 + '%' ))or(@Destenation2 is null))
					or ((UPPER(AL.AIR_DESTINATION) like upper('%' + @Destenation3 + '%' ))or(@Destenation3 is null))
					)

				order by tkt_nr

-- SP End
END

















