氀搀⸀䌀甀爀爀攀渀琀䌀爀攀搀椀琀䰀漀挀愀氀Ⰰ　⤀⤀ഀ਀        䄀匀 䰀䌀爀攀搀椀琀圀椀琀栀䌀栀椀氀搀猀ഀ਀ऀऀⰀ 砀⸀䌀甀爀爀攀渀琀䌀爀攀搀椀琀䌀甀爀爀攀渀挀礀Ⰰഀ਀    砀⸀䌀甀爀爀攀渀琀䌀爀攀搀椀琀䌀甀爀爀攀渀挀礀 ⬀ 匀唀䴀⠀䤀匀一唀䰀䰀⠀挀栀椀氀搀⸀䌀甀爀爀攀渀琀䌀爀攀搀椀琀䌀甀爀爀攀渀挀礀Ⰰ　⤀⤀ഀ਀        䄀匀 䌀爀攀搀椀琀圀椀琀栀䌀栀椀氀搀猀ഀ਀ऀऀⰀ 砀⸀䌀甀爀爀攀渀琀䐀攀戀椀琀䌀甀爀爀攀渀挀礀Ⰰഀ਀
    x.CurrentDebitCurrency + SUM(ISNULL(child.CurrentDebitCurrency,0))
        AS DebitWithChilds
		, x.CurrentDebitLocal,
    x.CurrentDebitLocal + SUM(ISNULL(child.CurrentDebitLocal,0))
        AS LDebitWithChilds,
		x.PrevCreditCurrency ,x.PrevCreditLocal,x.PrevDebitCurrency,
		x.PrevDebitLocal , x.AccountNameAr ,x.AccountNo
FROM [cteHierarchy] x
LEFT JOIN [cteHierarchy] child
    ON child.[Node].IsDescendantOf(x.[Node]) = 1
    AND child.[Node] <> x.[Node]
GROUP BY x.[Node], x.[Id], x.MainAccountNo, x.AcountNameEn, x.CurrentCreditLocal ,
x.CurrentDebitLocal,x.CurrentCreditCurrency,x.CurrentDebitCurrency
,x.PrevCreditLocal , x.PrevDebitLocal , x.PrevCreditCurrency,x.PrevDebitCurrency,
x.AccountNameAr ,x.AccountNo
ORDER BY x.[Id]

END



