搀愀琀攀崀Ⰰ㄀㄀㈀⤀ 愀猀 戀椀最椀渀琀⤀ 戀攀琀眀攀攀渀  䀀䐀愀琀攀䘀爀漀洀ⴀ㄀　　　　  愀渀搀 䀀䐀愀琀攀吀漀ⴀ㄀　　　　 愀渀搀  挀愀猀琀⠀爀攀瀀氀愀挀攀⠀嬀夀攀愀爀崀Ⰰ✀⼀✀Ⰰ✀✀⤀ 愀猀 戀椀最椀渀琀⤀㴀䀀夀攀愀爀一漀ⴀ㄀　　　㄀ഀ਀  愀渀搀 嬀䄀挀挀漀甀渀琀䤀䐀崀 椀渀 ⠀猀攀氀攀挀琀 䤀搀 昀爀漀洀 挀琀攀⤀⤀Ⰰ　⤀ഀ਀    Ⰰഀ਀
   TransActionToAccountID=ISNULL((select sum([Amount]) from [Budgeting].[BudgetTransaction] where cast(convert(char(8),[Transactiondate],112) as bigint) between  @DateFrom and @DateTo and cast(replace([Year],'/','') as bigint)=@YearNo
  and OtherAccount in (select Id from cte)),0) ,

     PrevTransActionToAccountID=ISNULL((select sum([Amount]) from [Budgeting].[BudgetTransaction] where cast(convert(char(8),[Transactiondate],112) as bigint) between  @DateFrom-10000  and @DateTo-10000 and  cast(replace([Year],'/','') as bigint)=@YearNo-10001
  and OtherAccount in (select Id from cte)),0)
  where Row#=@i

