伀琀栀攀爀䄀挀挀漀甀渀琀 椀渀 ⠀猀攀氀攀挀琀 䤀搀 昀爀漀洀 挀琀攀⤀⤀Ⰰ　⤀ Ⰰഀ਀ഀ਀
     PrevTransActionToAccountID=ISNULL((select sum([Amount]) from [Budgeting].[BudgetTransaction] where cast(convert(char(8),[Transactiondate],112) as bigint) between  @DateFrom-10000  and @DateTo-10000 and  cast(replace([Year],'/','') as bigint)=@YearNo-10001
  and OtherAccount in (select Id from cte)),0)
  where Row#=@i

