洀瀀一愀洀攀䄀爀 Ⰰ ഀ਀椀猀渀甀氀氀⠀攀洀瀀⸀䘀椀爀猀琀一愀洀攀䔀渀 Ⰰ ✀ ✀⤀ ⬀ ✀ ✀⬀ 椀猀渀甀氀氀⠀攀洀瀀⸀䴀椀搀搀氀攀一愀洀攀䔀渀 Ⰰ ✀ ✀ ⤀ ⬀✀ ✀⬀ ഀ਀椀猀渀甀氀氀⠀攀洀瀀⸀䈀攀昀漀爀攀䰀愀猀琀一愀洀攀䔀渀Ⰰ ✀ ✀⤀⬀ ✀ ✀⬀椀猀渀甀氀氀⠀攀洀瀀⸀䰀愀猀琀一愀洀攀䔀渀Ⰰ✀ ✀ ⤀愀猀 䔀洀瀀一愀洀攀䔀渀Ⰰഀ਀攀洀瀀⸀䨀漀椀渀椀渀最䐀愀琀攀Ⰰ渀愀琀⸀一愀洀攀 愀猀 一愀琀一愀洀攀Ⰰ渀愀琀⸀一愀洀攀䔀渀 愀猀 渀愀琀一愀洀攀䔀一Ⰰഀ਀
dept.ID as DeptID,dept.Code as DeptCode,Dept.Name as DeptName,dept.NameEn as deptNameEn,
isnull(sum(EndOfService_JournalDet.Debit),0) EndOfServiceDebit,
isnull(sum(EndOfService_JournalDet.Credit),0)as EndOfServiceCredit
 ,0 as Salary
 from [Nursing].Employee emp
inner join [hr].Department dept
on emp.SubDepartmentId=dept.ID
inner join [Registration].Nationalities Nat 
on emp.Nationality=nat.id
inner join gl.JournalDetails EndOfService_JournalDet
on emp.PensionAccount=EndOfService_JournalDet.AccountId
inner join gl.Journal EndOfService_Journal on 
EndOfService_JournalDet.JournalId=EndOfService_Journal.JournalId
 
where EndOfService_Journal.Date >= CONVERT(datetime,@DateFrom,103)
and  EndOfService_Journal.Date <= CONVERT(datetime,@DateTo,103)
and (emp.Id = @EmpID or @EmpID is null)
 and (emp.SubDepartmentId = @DeptID or @DeptID is null)
group by 
emp.id , emp.EmployeeCode , 
 
dept.ID ,dept.Code ,Dept.Name ,dept.NameEn ,
emp.FirstName ,emp.MiddleName,emp.BeforeLastName,
emp.LastName,emp.FirstNameAr ,emp.MiddleNameAr ,
emp.BeforeLastNameAr,emp.LastNameAr , emp.FirstNameEn , emp.MiddleNameEn , 
emp.BeforeLastNameEn,emp.LastNameEn,emp.JoiningDate,nat.Name ,nat.NameEn



END 




