 ഀ਀                         ⬀ ✀ ✀ ⬀ 䤀匀一唀䰀䰀⠀刀攀最椀猀琀爀愀琀椀漀渀⸀倀愀琀椀攀渀琀猀⸀䴀椀搀搀氀攀一愀洀攀㈀Ⰰ 一✀✀⤀ ⬀ ✀ ✀ ⬀ 䤀匀一唀䰀䰀⠀刀攀最椀猀琀爀愀琀椀漀渀⸀倀愀琀椀攀渀琀猀⸀䰀愀猀琀一愀洀攀Ⰰ 一✀✀⤀ 䄀匀 䘀甀氀氀一愀洀攀Ⰰഀ਀ऀऀऀऀऀऀ  䌀䄀匀䔀 䰀䔀䘀吀⠀伀甀琀倀愀琀椀攀渀琀⸀䤀渀瘀攀猀琀椀最愀琀椀漀渀刀攀焀甀攀猀琀䠀攀愀搀攀爀⸀伀倀开䤀倀一甀洀戀攀爀Ⰰ ㈀⤀ ഀ਀
                         WHEN 'OP' THEN 1 WHEN 'IP' THEN 2 WHEN 'ER' THEN 3 END AS patientType, 
						 Doctor.Name as doctorName ,
						 OutPatient.InvestigationRequestHeader.OP_IPNumber,
						  OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails.Done, 
                         OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails.InvestigationRequestId, 
						  Billing.PatientBillservices.Paid,
						   Registration.Patients.TranslatedFallName,
						   	CASE WHEN OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails.Cancelled = 1 THEN 1
							ELSE 0 END AS IsCancelled,
						    CASE WHEN sampleRecieved.IsCollected = 1 THEN 1
							ELSE 0 END AS IsCollected,
							CASE WHEN sampleEntry.Id IS NOT NULL THEN 1
							ELSE 0 END AS ISReceived,
							CASE WHEN  resultEntry.Id IS NOT NULL THEN 1
							ELSE 0 END AS ISCompleted,
							CASE WHEN sampleEntry.Id IS not NULL or  resultEntry.Id IS not NULL or sampleRecieved.IsCollected = 1 or OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails.Cancelled =1 then 0
							else 1 end as IsPending,
							test.TestName,section.SectionName,Specialty.SpecialtyName,
							Registration.Patients.PaymentType,
							 OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails.CancelledReason,
							 userdata.EnglishName as cancelledBy,
							 section.Id as sectionId,
							 Doctor.Id as doctorId,
							 test.Id as testId
							 
FROM            Registration.Patients  INNER JOIN
                         OutPatient.InvestigationRequestHeader ON Registration.Patients.Id = OutPatient.InvestigationRequestHeader.PatientID INNER JOIN
                         OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails ON OutPatient.InvestigationRequestHeader.Id = OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails.InvestigationRequestId INNER JOIN
                         ApplicationSetup.Service ON OutPatient.InvestigationRequestDetails.ServiceId = ApplicationSetup.Service.Id left JOIN
                         Registration.Doctors as Doctor on Doctor.Id =OutPatient.InvestigationRequestHeader.DoctorID 
