挀栀愀猀攀伀爀搀攀爀䠀攀愀搀攀爀 䰀倀伀䠀 伀一 䰀倀伀䐀⸀䰀倀伀䤀䐀 㴀 䰀倀伀䠀⸀䤀䐀ഀ਀ഀ਀䤀一一䔀刀 䨀伀䤀一ऀऀ 倀栀愀爀洀愀挀礀⸀䜀刀一开䰀倀伀猀 愀猀 䜀刀一开䰀倀伀猀匀甀戀 漀渀  ഀ਀䜀刀一开䰀倀伀猀匀甀戀⸀氀瀀漀椀搀㴀 䰀倀伀䠀⸀椀搀ഀ਀䤀一一䔀刀 䨀伀䤀一ऀऀ 倀栀愀爀洀愀挀礀⸀䜀漀漀搀猀刀攀挀攀椀瘀攀搀一漀琀攀䠀攀愀搀攀爀 䜀刀一䠀 ഀ਀伀一  䜀刀一开䰀倀伀猀匀甀戀⸀最爀渀椀搀 㴀 䜀刀一䠀⸀椀搀ഀ਀䤀一一䔀刀 䨀伀䤀一ऀऀഀ਀
 Pharmacy.GoodsReceivedNoteDetails GRND ON GRNH.ID = GRND.GRNId
and LPOD.DrugID = GRND.DrugID
INNER JOIN		 Pharmacy.GRNDetailsBatchesTransactions GRNBT ON GRNBT.GRNDetailsID = GRND.Id 
INNER JOIN		 Pharmacy.Batches BAT ON BAT.GRNDetailsId =GRNBT.GRNDetailsId  and BAT.Id=GRNBT.BatchId
INNER JOIN		 Pharmacy.DRugs DR ON GRND.DRugID = DR.ID 
INNER JOIN		 Pharmacy.UnitConversionFactor UCF ON LPOD.UnitConversionFactorId = UCF.ID
INNER JOIN		 Pharmacy.UnitTemplate UT ON UCF.UnitTemplateID = UT.ID 
INNER JOIN		 Pharmacy.Units UN ON UCF.UnitID =UN.ID
WHERE         GRNH.ID = @GRNId
END

