攀Ⰰ䐀爀甀最一愀洀攀 Ⰰ匀甀戀匀琀漀爀攀䤀䐀Ⰰ愀搀樀䐀愀琀攀Ⰰ匀甀戀猀琀漀爀攀一愀洀攀 ഀ਀唀渀椀漀渀ഀ਀ ⴀⴀ䄀搀樀甀猀琀洀攀渀琀 ⬀ഀ਀匀䔀䰀䔀䌀吀 䐀爀甀最䤀䐀 Ⰰ 匀甀戀匀琀漀爀攀䤀䐀Ⰰ匀甀戀猀琀漀爀攀一愀洀攀Ⰰ 　 伀甀琀最漀椀渀最Ⰰ 猀甀洀⠀䤀匀一唀䰀䰀⠀倀栀愀爀洀愀挀礀⸀嘀开倀栀礀猀椀挀愀氀䄀搀樀愀猀琀洀攀渀琀⸀儀琀夀䐀椀昀昀攀爀攀渀挀攀Ⰰ　⤀⤀ 椀渀挀漀洀椀渀最 Ⰰഀ਀
        Pharmacy.V_PhysicalAdjastment.adjDate,DrugCode,DrugName,'Adj-' describe	
FROM
	Pharmacy.V_PhysicalAdjastment
WHERE QtYDifference>0 and
	(@DrugFrom IS NULL OR Pharmacy.V_PhysicalAdjastment.DrugID >= @DrugFrom) 
	AND (@DrugTo IS NULL OR V_PhysicalAdjastment.DrugID  <= @DrugTo)
	AND (@SubStoreFrom IS NULL OR Pharmacy.V_PhysicalAdjastment.[SubStoreID] >= @SubStoreFrom) 
	AND (@SubStoreTo IS NULL OR V_PhysicalAdjastment.[SubstoreID] <= @SubStoreTo)
	AND (@classFrom IS NULL OR ClassID >= @classFrom) AND (@classTo IS NULL OR ClassID <= @classTo)
	AND (@dateFrom IS NULL OR adjDate < Cast(@dateFrom as Date)) 
GROUP BY
	DrugID,DrugCode,DrugName ,SubStoreID,adjDate,SubstoreName 

union
SELECT
DrugID , SubstoreID,SubstoreName,  SUM(ISNULL(V_DirectSubtract.[QTY], 0)) Outgoing, 0 incoming ,[OperationDate],DrugCode,DrugName,'DSub' describe	
FROM
[Pharmacy].[Drugs]
	LEFT OUTER JOIN [Pharmacy].[DrugClassification] ON [Drugs].[ClassificationId] = [DrugClassification].[ID]
	INNER JOIN Pharmacy.V_DirectSubtract ON [Drugs].[ID] = V_DirectSubtract.[DrugID]
	
	INNER JOIN [Pharmacy].[Substores] ON Pharmacy.V_DirectSubtract.[SubstoreID] = [Pharmacy].[Substores].[ID]
WHERE
(@DrugFrom IS NULL OR [Drugs].[ID] >= @DrugFrom) 
AND (@DrugTo IS NULL OR [Drugs].[ID] <= @DrugTo)
AND (@SubStoreFrom IS NULL OR Pharmacy.V_DirectSubtract.[SubstoreID] >= @SubStoreFrom) 
AND (@SubStoreTo IS NULL OR Pharmacy.V_DirectSubtract.[SubstoreID] <= @SubStoreTo)
AND (@classFrom IS NULL OR [Drugs].[ClassificationId] >= @classFrom) 
AND (@classTo IS NULL OR [Drugs].[ClassificationId] <= @classTo)
AND (@dateFrom IS NULL OR Pharmacy.V_DirectSubtract.[OperationDate] < Cast(@dateFrom as Date))
GROUP BY
DrugID,DrugCode,DrugName ,Pharmacy.V_DirectSubtract.SubstoreID,[OperationDate],SubstoreName 
union
SELECT
DrugID , SubstoreID,SubstoreName, 0 Outgoing, SUM(ISNULL(V_DirectAddition.[QTY], 0)) incoming ,[OperationDate],DrugCode,DrugName,'DAdd' describe	
FROM
[Pharmacy].[Drugs]
	LEFT OUTER JOIN [Pharmacy].[DrugClassification] ON [Drugs].[ClassificationId] = [DrugClassification].[ID]
	INNER JOIN Pharmacy.V_DirectAddition ON [Drugs].[ID] = Pharmacy.V_DirectAddition.[DrugID]
	
